{"ID":"20240513082940-ibscnva","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240513082940-ibscnva","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513082940-ibscnva\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513180256-nnqaae9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240513180256-nnqaae9\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:600\u0026#125;","title":"353","type":"doc","updated":"20240515114833"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240513180256-nnqaae9","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"width: 732px;","id":"20240513180256-nnqaae9","updated":"20240515114833"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"倪醫師病案紀錄"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    初診日期：20080515"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"姓名"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"245 W, T"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"性別"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"M"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"年齡及體型"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"36歲，高"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診日期"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"20080515"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"來診原因："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 臉上有紅疹(青春痘後遺症)."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 後腦有乒乓球大的不生髮區(蟹足腫)，為十年前水痘後，遺留至今"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 肚臍周圍持續痛，感覺有壞死食物未去."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 小便黃或淡"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 大便秘，隔日一行，無排氣"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 胃口好，無噁心"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 口渴有，喜冰冷飲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5. 無腸鳴或水聲"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6. 睡不好，4-5小時左右"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7. 體力好"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8. 自覺過熱"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"尺脈數"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淡黃乾."},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷："},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陽明經腑皆熱."}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方："},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 石膏二兩  知母五錢   "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"厚朴二錢  枳實三錢  大黃三錢  芒硝二錢(分二包沖服)"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 陽明經腑熱并去. "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"四付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"六碗煮二碗  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 石膏三兩  知母五錢  淮山三錢  薏仁五錢  赤小豆五錢  杏仁三錢  甘草三錢  蒼朮三錢  黃芩三錢  蟬蛻五分 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"→ 去胃濕熱并去面部濕熱 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"十付  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"九碗煮三碗  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"早晚飯前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"(1) 繞臍痛無屁是為大便堵在大腸,大承氣湯症."},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"備註："}]}]}]}]}